    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1075">

                <pb facs="1100" n="980" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg980"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Hutchinson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-05-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 24,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hutchinson reports that court of first instance gave decision against the
                    New York and Bermudez Company last Saturday on Hamilton concession, annulling
                    concession, and damages to be assessed by experts.</p>
                <p>The case will be appealed to full court.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
